{
  "name": "21 · Ingesta de documentos para RAG",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 21 · Ingesta RAG\n\nCrea en Postgres/Supabase la tabla:\n\ndocumentos_rag (id serial, titulo text, origen text, idioma text, indice int, trozo text, embedding_estado text, creado_en timestamptz)\n\nAsigna credenciales de Postgres y de Google Sheets y ajusta el ID de la hoja.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 260
      },
      "id": "nodo_001",
      "name": "Nota de configuración",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Prueba rápida\n\nEnvía un POST al webhook con JSON:\ntitulo, contenido, origen (obligatorios) e idioma (opcional).\n\nLa rama inferior responde 400 si falta algún campo.",
        "width": 340,
        "height": 200
      },
      "id": "nodo_002",
      "name": "Nota de prueba",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        420,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "wf-21-doc-nuevo",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo_003",
      "name": "Documento nuevo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const b = $json.body || {};\nconst requeridos = ['titulo', 'contenido', 'origen'];\nconst faltan = requeridos.filter(function (campo) {\n  const v = b[campo];\n  return v === undefined || v === null || String(v).trim() === '';\n});\nconst salida = {\n  titulo: String(b.titulo || '').trim(),\n  contenido: String(b.contenido || '').trim(),\n  origen: String(b.origen || '').trim(),\n  idioma: String(b.idioma || 'es').trim(),\n  faltan: faltan,\n  valido: faltan.length === 0,\n  recibido_en: new Date().toISOString()\n};\nreturn { json: salida };"
      },
      "id": "nodo_004",
      "name": "Validar documento",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond_001",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.valido }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo_005",
      "name": "¿Documento completo?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const d=$input.first().json;\nconst text=String(d.contenido||'');\nif(!text.trim()||text.length>1000000)throw new Error('Document empty or larger than 1 million characters');\nconst chunks=[];\nfor(let i=0,index=0;i<text.length;i+=1000,index++)chunks.push({indice:index,trozo:text.slice(i,i+1200)});\nreturn [{json:{...d,chunks} }];"
      },
      "id": "nodo_006",
      "name": "Trocear contenido",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT * FROM academy_ingest_document($1,$2,$3,$4,$5::jsonb);",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [$json.origen,$json.titulo,$json.idioma,$json.contenido,JSON.stringify($json.chunks)] }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "nodo_007",
      "name": "Guardar trozos en Postgres",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        880,
        240
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Postgres (Supabase)"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Apply rag_storage.sql first. The function replaces each source atomically, deduplicates unchanged versions and removes stale chunks."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const r=$input.first().json; return [{json:{...r,estado:r.changed?'ingresado':'sin_cambios',fecha:new Date().toISOString()} }];"
      },
      "id": "nodo_008",
      "name": "Resumir ingesta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "REEMPLAZAR_ID_DOCUMENTO"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Ingestas"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo_009",
      "name": "Registrar en Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1320,
        240
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Google Sheets (OAuth2)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { ok: true, titulo: $json.titulo, trozos_guardados: $json.trozos_guardados } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo_010",
      "name": "Responder OK",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1540,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { ok: false, error: 'faltan_campos', faltan: $json.faltan } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 400
        }
      },
      "id": "nodo_011",
      "name": "Responder incompleto",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        660,
        460
      ]
    }
  ],
